<div class="concept-name">Low-Level Keyboard Hook</div>
<div class="concept-desc">通过 Windows 底层钩子在系统分发前捕获按键消息。</div>
</div>
<div class="concept-chip">
<div class="concept-name">Virtual Key &amp; Scan Code</div>
<div class="concept-desc">区分虚拟键码与硬件扫描码，准确识别具体按键来源。</div>
</div>
<div class="concept-chip">
<div class="concept-name">按下与释放事件</div>
<div class="concept-desc">区分 KeyDown 与 KeyUp，保障按键生命周期完整。</div>
</div>
